    "taxonId": 165369,
    "summary": "A small annual grass native to western and southwestern Europe. It grows in open vegetation on moist sand, forming tufts of hair-thin stems with two or three leaves clustered at or near the base.",
    "humanEdibility": "unknown",
    "edibilityNote": null,
